STDOUT - I/O - Keyword

Description:
  Writes outputs the terminal emulator, uses the standard output protocol
  printing to screen.

  Flags can be used to change the output
  -ds     Printing Structs
  -t      Printing Types
  <none>  Standard Printing

  Color codes can be used as well:
  -r     Red
  -g     Green
  -y     Yellow
  -b     Blue
  -m     Magenta
  -c     Cyan
  -w     White
  -d     Dark Gray
  -n     Reset

Usage:
  
  stdout "Hello World"


